{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02899","headline":"和长孙秘监七夕 · 任希古","name":"和长孙秘监七夕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二秋叶神媛，七夕望仙妃。\n影照河阳妓，色丽平津闱。\n鹊桥波里出，龙车霄外飞。\n露泫低珠佩，云移荐锦衣。\n更深黄月落，夜久靥星稀。\n空接灵台下，方恧辨支机。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任希古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02899.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02899","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}